Package: legoplots
Title: Three-Dimensional Lego Plots for Mutational Signatures
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Ramin", "Sakhtemani", email = "ramin.sakhtemani@nih.gov",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Draws SBS96 mutational spectra as static, projected
    three-dimensional bar plots. The implementation uses base R graphics,
    works on headless systems, and provides separate functions for computing
    plot layouts and rendering them.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    grDevices,
    graphics,
    stats,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    gifski
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
